cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "hep_cot: HEP paper literature reasoning copilot with comparative CoT study"
abstract: >-
  A tool-using LLM agent for reading HEP experimental papers (arXiv LaTeX
  source, figures, HEPData, INSPIRE reference graph) and a comparative
  reasoning-study harness that benchmarks teacher/student model pairs on
  structured paper-analysis tasks with autoloop refinement.
type: software
authors:
